        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for a hidden object game that's as cute as it is challenging? Jump into &quot;100 Hidden Capybaras&quot; – the ultimate hidden object adventure where your mission is to find and collect 100 adorable capybaras, each hiding in beautifully designed scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288020/extras/503eb4917e7029e265a0edb03289a945.poster.avif?t=1752568319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288020/extras/503eb4917e7029e265a0edb03289a945.webm?t=1752568319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 Explore stunning environments filled with lush forests, charming villages, secret dungeons, and unknown planets. 🏘🐉🪐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288020/extras/67b9714845aeef907f7fedb0d6dd7f49.poster.avif?t=1752568319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288020/extras/67b9714845aeef907f7fedb0d6dd7f49.webm?t=1752568319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all hiding spots for our fluffy friends as you put your observation skills to the test. 🔍</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288020/extras/bcf20d444847ae7696f307c1cb107de1.poster.avif?t=1752568319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a